<title>FRANCE: TF1 1996 profit falls 4.5 pct.</title>
<headline>TF1 1996 profit falls 4.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable			     575  vs	     602</p>
<p>    Net dividend (francs)			 16  vs     not given</p>
<p>    Gross dividend (francs)		     24  vs     not given</p>
<p>    Turnover				     9,685  vs	   9,140</p>
<p>     - Advertising TF1			 7,424  vs	   7,343</p>
<p>     - Other				     2,261  vs	   1,797</p>
<p>NOTE - French private television channel TF1 said the results included charges of 33 million francs from the cost of the launch of Television Par Satellite (TPS) and amortisation of goodwill from the acquisition of GLEM and Film par Film.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
